he pulse-pounding excitement of mixed-reality home defense combat with the engaging gameplay style inspired by Vampire Survivor. As a part of the RIFTERs, you'll encounter:\n\n- True Survival Horde for Mixed Reality: Experience frantic home invasions via spatial portals (RIFT) straight into your living room. Arm yourself with the teleported mech arm and construct in-home fortifications for protection.\n\n- Hordes of Enemies from Diverse Apocalypses: Confront a vast assortment of zombies and monsters congregating for intense rogue-like battles. Navigate through a sequence of realistic battlefields laden with unique challenges.\n\n- Addictive Vampire Survivor-Inspired Gameplay: Swiftly collect EXP gems to obtain randomized power-ups. Customize, unlock, and enhance your mech build, consisting of 12 intricately designed weapons and machinery systems.\n", "short_description": "Rift Hero is an exhilarating roguelike horde survival shooter designed for mixed reality, featuring a captivating blend of the heart-pounding mixed-reality home defense battle and the addictive gameplay mechanics like Vampire Survivor."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://skycampstudio.com/rift-hero-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skycamp Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://skycampstudio.com/rift/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"]